        "onlineTime": "2026-09-12 22:00:00",
        "offlineTime": "2040-10-31 23:59:59",
        "content": "<p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">《相约1999》之2026箱中巡游 · 特别前瞻节目现已结束，感谢大家的观看与支持！</span></p><div data-w-e-type=\"video\" data-w-e-is-void>\n<iframe src=\"//player.bilibili.com/player.html?isOutside=true&amp;aid=117240259153106&amp;bvid=BV1vYYx6HEyt&amp;cid=41832484161&amp;p=1\" scrolling=\"no\" border=\"0\" frameborder=\"no\" framespacing=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" class=\"video\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\"></iframe>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">《重返未来：1999》2026箱中巡游 · 4.0「应门者」即将于9月24日上映，敬请期待！</span></p>",
        "digest": null,
        "guideUrl": "https://gamecms-res.sl916.com/official_website_resource/50001/4/INFORMATION/20260914/回顾视频封面_1920×1080_5094594a64bb447c803d6c1bdbf08722.jpg",
